<li id="StudioSplashScreen" data-authentication-url="/Login/Negotiate.ashx">
    <div class="header-bg-container">
        <div class="header-bg">
            <div class="header-container">
                <img class="studio-icon" src="/images/2102c93be4232dff678e4866267669ec.png">
                <h3>JOIN THE #1 USER-GENERATED GAMING COMMUNITY</h3>
                <p class="header-text">
                    Our FREE platform enables anyone to push the limits of their imagination by creating immersive 3D multiplayer games and easily publish them to millions of players.
                </p>
                <p class="mobile-text-header">
                    Download ROBLOX Studio - available on PC and Mac to get started!
                </p>
                <button type="button" id="studio-launch" class="btn-primary-md">Open ROBLOX Studio</button>
                <p>
                    <a class="small" href="/newlogin?ReturnUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.roblox.com%2Fdevelop%3Fclose%3D1">Continue to Develop page</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-container">
        <ul class="blurbs-container">
            <li class="blurb gear ">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <p class="text-lead">All-In-One Development Engine</p>
                    <p>Our best-in-class authoring environment allows creators to build immersive 3D cross-platform games and launch them simultaneously on PC, Mac, iOS and Android devices, Xbox One and Oculus Rift.</p>
                    <br>
                    <ul class="dev-engine-list">
                        <li>Built-in multiplayer and monetization tools</li>
                        <li>One-click publishing</li>
                        <li>Free cloud hosting</li>
                        <li>Robust asset library</li>
                    </ul>
                    <img src="/images/b5a31363778e6d95036d684a71b3eebe.png">
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="blurb friends ">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <p class="text-lead">Reach Millions of Players</p>
                    <p>Connect with a massive audience by tapping into an incredibly enthusiastic and international community of over 28 million monthly players.</p>
                    <img src="/images/610d1e9e62b0fe55c2590b410d5ab3c9.png">
                </div>
            </li>
                <li class="blurb money">
                    <div class="section-content">
                        <p class="text-lead">Control Your Monetization</p>
                        <p>
                            Our shared economy gives you full control of your in-game monetization. Top developers are on track to earn $20,000 to $50,000 per month from our DevEx program. We’ve paid out over $6 million dollars to developers to date.
                        </p>
                        <img src="/images/41cc0c5852485b140c12bc46a982e319.png">
                    </div>
                </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mobile-text">
            <p>Download ROBLOX Studio - available</p>
            <p>on PC and Mac to get started!</p>
            <div class="mobile-icons">
                <img src="/images/647107c6fdfd5d84a150150220a4d2c4.png">
                <img src="/images/be40338612aa9db956e3c473d99e424d.png">
            </div>
        </div>

